WEBVTT

01:35.759 --> 01:40.870
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.450 --> 01:44.000
[Episode 27]

01:45.310 --> 01:46.370
This way, My Lords.

01:49.000 --> 01:49.680
Feng Suige,

01:50.840 --> 01:52.560
I know I'm doomed to fail.

01:54.150 --> 01:55.880
I can clear your mother's name,

01:56.640 --> 01:58.170
but you must solemnly swear

01:58.620 --> 01:59.840
to spare

02:00.840 --> 02:02.500
the Zhuang family after I die.

02:04.040 --> 02:04.790
Feng Suige,

02:05.230 --> 02:06.680
I took Wei Qingyu's life.

02:06.790 --> 02:08.320
Only I am the killer of your mother.

02:08.320 --> 02:09.280
Come at me!

02:09.470 --> 02:10.030
Shut up!

02:14.130 --> 02:16.350
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

02:25.030 --> 02:25.829
Feng Suige...

02:42.430 --> 02:43.240
Feng Suige!

02:56.470 --> 02:57.150
Father!

02:58.400 --> 02:59.710
She has nothing to do

03:01.360 --> 03:02.820
with the feuds between us.

03:03.520 --> 03:05.180
You should take revenge on me.

03:05.430 --> 03:06.360
Don't hurt her.

03:17.040 --> 03:22.540
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

03:21.470 --> 03:22.910
Fifteen years ago,

03:24.030 --> 03:26.240
how did my mother die?

03:38.200 --> 03:39.230
Feng Suige!

03:41.470 --> 03:44.190
I demand you tell everyone

03:45.360 --> 03:47.860
why you killed her.

03:48.360 --> 03:50.030
I'm responsible for your mother's death.

03:48.910 --> 03:50.450
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

03:50.079 --> 03:51.870
I ended that hateful woman's life
with my own hands!

03:51.870 --> 03:53.800
Your mother was killed by no one but me.

03:53.800 --> 03:55.200
Come at me. I dare you!

03:55.310 --> 03:57.280
Take my life! Let my father go!

04:05.080 --> 04:07.360
Will you confess or not?

04:12.870 --> 04:16.329
I, Zhuang Shen, will
take full responsibility for my actions.

04:17.269 --> 04:18.720
All I've done has nothing

04:20.040 --> 04:21.680
to do with my daughter,

04:26.560 --> 04:28.360
or the rest of the Zhuang family.

04:28.830 --> 04:29.600
Feng Suige,

04:30.870 --> 04:32.930
avenge your mother by taking my life.

04:33.510 --> 04:34.720
Do not hurt my family.

04:34.750 --> 04:37.240
You're in no position
to negotiate terms with me!

04:37.240 --> 04:39.310
I'll ask you one last time.

04:40.120 --> 04:42.190
Fifteen years ago, at this very place,

04:42.190 --> 04:44.000
why did you kill my mother?

04:47.200 --> 04:49.930
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

04:50.750 --> 04:52.700
I made one mistake,

04:52.830 --> 04:54.510
and now I've completely lost.

04:59.390 --> 05:00.520
Indeed, you've won.

05:01.750 --> 05:03.950
But it's simply because you're in luck.

05:04.310 --> 05:07.240
I'm defeated by bad luck,

05:07.720 --> 05:09.510
not you.

05:23.750 --> 05:25.240
Fifteen years ago...

05:25.360 --> 05:26.040
Father...

05:26.560 --> 05:28.070
Father, what are you going to say?

05:28.070 --> 05:28.910
Keep quiet!

05:29.000 --> 05:30.560
Don't speak a word!

05:31.000 --> 05:32.070
Don't!

05:32.750 --> 05:34.870
I plotted against the late Empress.

05:36.680 --> 05:38.390
She was not a spy for Jinxiu.

05:39.000 --> 05:41.270
I just fabricated evidence

05:41.390 --> 05:42.650
to frame her.

05:47.409 --> 05:49.340
I also killed her with my own hands.

05:49.920 --> 05:51.130
I did all that

05:51.360 --> 05:53.230
just to get the late Empress
out of the way!

05:53.230 --> 05:55.250
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

05:59.030 --> 06:01.590
[Changchun Palace]

06:04.800 --> 06:06.060
Are you satisfied now?

06:07.310 --> 06:08.110
No!

06:20.950 --> 06:23.480
Leave the Zhuang family alone.

06:27.870 --> 06:29.160
Father!

06:28.630 --> 06:31.370
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

06:51.120 --> 06:52.390
Father!

06:53.720 --> 06:54.560
Let go of me!

07:12.270 --> 07:13.040
Father...

07:14.920 --> 07:16.000
No...

07:37.950 --> 07:38.750
No!

07:43.480 --> 07:44.390
Father...

07:44.720 --> 07:46.310
Father!

07:53.610 --> 07:56.200
[Changchun Palace]

08:11.820 --> 08:12.620
Your Majesty,

08:12.800 --> 08:14.240
I got the news already.

08:19.190 --> 08:20.720
Summon the First Prince.

08:21.950 --> 08:23.430
I need to see him.

08:24.120 --> 08:24.600
Yes.

08:34.909 --> 08:35.809
Your Highness,

08:35.840 --> 08:38.169
His Majesty has requested your presence.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.179
Your Highness!

08:39.750 --> 08:41.409
His Majesty has summoned you.

08:42.840 --> 08:43.600
Your Highness,

08:43.600 --> 08:45.600
please don't defy imperial orders.

08:46.790 --> 08:48.000
Tell him this:

08:49.750 --> 08:51.080
from this moment forth,

08:51.390 --> 08:52.790
the bond between him and me
as father and son,

08:52.790 --> 08:53.910
and as lord and liege,

08:53.910 --> 08:55.390
is completely severed.

09:06.270 --> 09:07.130
Your Highness!

09:19.550 --> 09:21.010
Our bond as father and son,

09:22.000 --> 09:23.270
and as lord and liege,

09:24.000 --> 09:26.200
is completely severed.

09:29.200 --> 09:31.790
What a clean break.

09:34.870 --> 09:35.800
Your Majesty...

09:37.480 --> 09:38.480
Qingyu,

09:40.750 --> 09:42.200
I have lost to you.

09:45.630 --> 09:46.550
Oh, Qingyu,

09:47.000 --> 09:49.030
though I've lost,

09:50.200 --> 09:51.510
our son...

09:54.480 --> 09:55.840
No, your son.

09:57.000 --> 09:58.720
Your son has won.

10:01.000 --> 10:01.600
Qingyu!

10:02.720 --> 10:04.550
Your son has avenged you.

10:07.120 --> 10:08.480
You must be gratified.

10:16.150 --> 10:18.200
The First Prince has done

10:18.910 --> 10:20.220
what he should.

10:21.120 --> 10:22.030
It's time

10:22.600 --> 10:24.150
I took care of the rest.

10:25.370 --> 10:26.870
Deliver my edict as follows.

10:26.870 --> 10:28.200
Confiscate the Zhuang family's property.

10:28.200 --> 10:31.130
All male members
of the Zhuang family will be exiled,

10:31.320 --> 10:33.240
and the female ones will serve

10:33.360 --> 10:34.790
as palace maids.

10:35.030 --> 10:35.630
What about

10:35.910 --> 10:36.640
the Empress?

10:38.240 --> 10:39.370
She is in more misery

10:40.360 --> 10:41.720
alive than dead.

10:44.120 --> 10:45.550
This is her fate.

10:48.000 --> 10:49.600
I shall carry out the decree.

11:07.030 --> 11:07.870
Your Majesty,

11:08.480 --> 11:09.600
His Majesty has ordered

11:09.600 --> 11:10.550
to have this body taken

11:10.550 --> 11:11.550
out of the palace.

11:15.870 --> 11:16.670
Your Majesty,

11:17.200 --> 11:18.270
His Majesty has also

11:18.270 --> 11:21.470
ordered the Zhuang family's property
to be confiscated.

11:25.870 --> 11:27.070
What did you just say?

11:27.790 --> 11:28.750
Please let me

11:28.790 --> 11:29.850
take the body away.

11:30.360 --> 11:32.360
I promise to bury the prime minister

11:32.670 --> 11:33.870
in a proper cemetery.

11:34.630 --> 11:36.510
My father is already dead.

11:38.030 --> 11:40.120
Am I not even allowed to bury him?

11:40.060 --> 11:43.390
[Changchun Palace]

11:40.200 --> 11:42.620
The Zhuang family's ancestral hall
will also be demolished.

11:42.620 --> 11:44.320
There is nowhere
for Your Majesty to bury him.

11:44.320 --> 11:46.380
It's better to let me handle his body.

11:49.390 --> 11:51.320
Is this what Feng Pingcheng wants?

11:54.670 --> 11:55.870
What are you doing?

11:56.000 --> 11:56.750
Stop!

11:58.150 --> 11:59.120
Stop!

12:00.000 --> 12:00.840
Father!

12:01.840 --> 12:02.390
Father...

12:02.390 --> 12:03.150
Imperial orders cannot be defied.

12:03.150 --> 12:03.790
Father...

12:03.790 --> 12:06.850
Please don't make this difficult for us,
Your Majesty.

12:12.270 --> 12:12.870
Slowly.

12:18.360 --> 12:18.960
Good.

12:20.840 --> 12:21.900
Someone come here!

12:22.960 --> 12:23.440
Sir.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.720
Prepare these herbs and cook them.

12:29.720 --> 12:30.320
Yes.

12:33.150 --> 12:34.650
My work's finally done.

12:34.930 --> 12:36.330
Thank you for the effort.

12:36.720 --> 12:38.780
I shouldn't have come to Yujing City.

12:38.960 --> 12:40.390
I'm physically and mentally exhausted.

12:40.390 --> 12:42.200
Look, the room's filled with patients.

12:42.200 --> 12:43.130
And previously,

12:43.200 --> 12:44.000
after fixing your hand

12:44.000 --> 12:45.510
and saving Ning Fei's life,

12:45.510 --> 12:47.320
I rushed to the imperial palace

12:47.320 --> 12:48.150
immediately

12:48.200 --> 12:49.600
to treat Feng Pingcheng.

12:50.000 --> 12:51.260
I didn't sleep or rest.

12:51.660 --> 12:53.670
That guy Feng Pingcheng is the worst.

12:53.670 --> 12:54.390
I put in so much effort

12:54.390 --> 12:55.990
in curing an ungrateful man!

12:58.080 --> 12:59.670
For saving so many lives,

12:59.750 --> 13:01.830
you're literally a living god.

13:02.630 --> 13:03.690
A living god?

13:04.480 --> 13:05.960
I think my trip to Yujing City

13:05.960 --> 13:07.510
is for trials and tribulations.

13:07.510 --> 13:08.960
I'll leave
as soon as I finish this cup of tea,

13:08.960 --> 13:10.420
without a moment's delay.

13:13.030 --> 13:14.870
In my opinion, your trip to Yujing City

13:14.870 --> 13:17.200
is to help others
through trials and tribulations.

13:17.200 --> 13:18.800
Don't think I didn't notice.

13:18.840 --> 13:20.360
When you were treating patients,

13:20.360 --> 13:21.560
you spared no effort.

13:24.510 --> 13:26.630
You helped several people
at a time all by yourself.

13:26.630 --> 13:28.120
You're not only proficient in medicine,

13:28.120 --> 13:29.850
but also ready to give your all.

13:30.320 --> 13:31.290
You always claim

13:31.390 --> 13:33.360
to never fight for the living
against the Grim Reaper.

13:33.360 --> 13:34.150
But in fact,

13:34.300 --> 13:35.320
you'd hate to see

13:35.360 --> 13:36.840
any lives around you being taken

13:36.840 --> 13:38.210
by the Grim Reaper.

13:40.170 --> 13:41.770
What a smooth talker you are.

13:42.380 --> 13:43.980
A perceptive observer, too.

13:44.220 --> 13:45.150
I'm telling you,

13:45.440 --> 13:46.320
the moment I cure all the patients

13:46.320 --> 13:47.050
in this room,

13:47.550 --> 13:48.630
I'll leave right away,

13:48.630 --> 13:50.090
without wasting a moment.

13:50.360 --> 13:51.090
Miss Yixiao.

13:51.200 --> 13:51.920
Lord Ling.

13:52.040 --> 13:53.240
His Highness is back.

13:58.080 --> 14:00.410
You're only halfway through the massage!

14:10.630 --> 14:11.870
I killed Zhuang Shen.

14:13.720 --> 14:14.720
It's all over now.

14:18.210 --> 14:21.100
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

14:21.930 --> 14:24.960
♪ Fold the heaven and earth
to make my wings ♪

14:25.550 --> 14:26.970
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

14:27.270 --> 14:31.070
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

14:32.860 --> 14:36.070
♪ I thought in this life
I'd drift like a solitary sail ♪

14:36.620 --> 14:39.720
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

14:37.360 --> 14:38.440
You've taken your revenge.

14:38.440 --> 14:40.200
It's time you pampered yourself.

14:40.030 --> 14:43.000
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

14:43.600 --> 14:46.320
♪ My eyes ♪

14:45.030 --> 14:47.080
I'm hosting a banquet at my place today.

14:47.080 --> 14:48.140
You should join us.

14:48.600 --> 14:50.000
Not tonight, I'm afraid.

14:50.320 --> 14:52.240
Though that old punk Zhuang Shen is dead,

14:52.240 --> 14:53.150
I still need to clean up

14:53.150 --> 14:54.280
the mess he created.

14:54.550 --> 14:55.270
When these patients

14:55.270 --> 14:56.470
make a full recovery,

14:56.480 --> 14:58.080
I'll have lots of drinks with you.

14:58.080 --> 15:00.210
Didn't you say you'd leave right away?

15:00.320 --> 15:01.870
I'll hit the road after the drinking,

15:01.870 --> 15:03.400
instantly and decisively.

15:04.030 --> 15:04.910
After helping Lord Ling

15:04.910 --> 15:06.110
finish the work here,

15:06.150 --> 15:07.390
come to my place for drinks.

15:07.390 --> 15:08.320
Sounds good.

15:17.920 --> 15:18.980
Where are we going?

15:20.030 --> 15:21.390
I'd like you to be with me

15:21.870 --> 15:23.270
for an important moment.

15:29.950 --> 15:32.150
[Wutong Mansion]

15:31.600 --> 15:32.460
Your Highness,

15:32.670 --> 15:33.870
Elder Marquis Murong is here.

15:33.870 --> 15:35.470
His Grace is waiting inside.

15:57.440 --> 15:58.700
Elder Marquis Murong,

15:58.960 --> 15:59.910
I apologize for abducting

15:59.910 --> 16:00.910
Your Grace earlier.

16:00.910 --> 16:02.440
That was entirely my doing.

16:02.670 --> 16:03.870
If you are to blame anyone,

16:03.870 --> 16:04.600
let it be me.

16:05.890 --> 16:07.220
I didn't come here today

16:08.080 --> 16:09.810
to pursue this matter further,

16:10.960 --> 16:12.550
or to lash out at you.

16:13.870 --> 16:15.600
Then I guess you came here today

16:15.910 --> 16:17.170
for Murong Yao, right?

16:25.710 --> 16:27.080
I've heard

16:28.480 --> 16:29.440
what Yao did.

16:30.390 --> 16:30.960
I...

16:37.720 --> 16:38.720
As of now,

16:40.030 --> 16:41.000
do you still consider me

16:41.000 --> 16:42.200
as your Uncle Murong?

16:42.320 --> 16:43.120
Of course I do.

16:44.240 --> 16:46.100
You'll always be my Uncle Murong.

16:48.870 --> 16:49.360
Good.

16:50.360 --> 16:51.600
Then I'm afraid I have

16:51.600 --> 16:52.630
a big favor to ask.

16:53.030 --> 16:54.120
I need to save Yao.

16:56.030 --> 16:57.150
Will you help me?

17:17.260 --> 17:18.200
I get it.

17:20.160 --> 17:21.089
Uncle Murong...

17:46.090 --> 17:50.030
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

17:51.000 --> 17:51.590
Mother,

17:52.860 --> 17:54.530
our enemy died.

17:54.780 --> 17:56.810
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

17:59.670 --> 18:01.070
I'm not a good enough son,

18:02.310 --> 18:04.510
for making you wait so long for this day.

18:06.400 --> 18:07.310
Today, I brought

18:07.310 --> 18:08.640
a special someone here.

18:09.270 --> 18:10.350
She is Fu Yixiao.

18:20.450 --> 18:23.910
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

18:21.270 --> 18:21.830
Mother,

18:22.830 --> 18:23.960
after your passing,

18:24.310 --> 18:25.920
I always felt like I was

18:25.920 --> 18:27.720
struggling in a quagmire alone.

18:28.070 --> 18:30.990
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

18:28.830 --> 18:30.430
I wouldn't say it was bitter,

18:30.880 --> 18:32.430
but the sky I saw was dark.

18:33.830 --> 18:34.890
In all these years,

18:37.830 --> 18:39.830
I never ceased to try turning myself

18:39.880 --> 18:41.790
to be as evil as those people.

18:43.030 --> 18:44.070
I thought only in that way

18:44.070 --> 18:45.400
could I defeat them

18:46.590 --> 18:48.110
and avenge you.

18:48.640 --> 18:53.020
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

18:49.310 --> 18:50.350
But in fact,

18:51.170 --> 18:53.370
I was already knee deep in the quagmire,

18:53.400 --> 18:55.400
nearly unable to extricate myself.

18:59.100 --> 19:01.530
It all changed when I met her.

19:02.720 --> 19:03.660
She...

19:04.400 --> 19:06.130
brightened the sky in my world.

19:07.680 --> 19:08.350
I finally

19:08.350 --> 19:10.280
got to see the sun, moon, and stars.

19:11.680 --> 19:12.510
Only then

19:12.510 --> 19:14.400
did I find the meaning of my life,

19:15.400 --> 19:16.930
and become able to envision

19:17.550 --> 19:18.590
what kind of life

19:18.590 --> 19:20.590
I should lead after taking revenge.

19:23.960 --> 19:25.440
In every coming day

19:25.440 --> 19:26.900
I could possibly imagine,

19:27.790 --> 19:29.450
Yixiao is always there for me.

19:34.200 --> 19:35.000
Rest assured.

19:36.030 --> 19:37.030
We are doing well.

19:38.350 --> 19:39.150
In the future,

19:39.510 --> 19:41.000
we'll live our lives to the fullest.

19:39.650 --> 19:41.570
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

19:41.720 --> 19:43.580
I'll also take good care of Suige.

19:45.000 --> 19:45.640
Yixiao,

19:47.790 --> 19:49.110
would you join me

19:49.550 --> 19:51.030
in kowtowing to my mother?

19:56.290 --> 19:57.460
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

20:02.250 --> 20:03.970
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

20:10.310 --> 20:12.460
I think I heard my mother speaking.

20:15.270 --> 20:16.200
What did she say?

20:16.640 --> 20:18.000
She asked if you could

20:19.400 --> 20:20.510
call her "Mother."

20:22.480 --> 20:24.280
I've been parentless for as long

20:24.960 --> 20:25.960
as I can remember.

20:26.830 --> 20:27.640
Never have I

20:27.640 --> 20:29.040
called anyone "Mother."

20:30.550 --> 20:32.430
Now, a kind lady
would like to be my mother.

20:32.430 --> 20:34.950
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

20:33.160 --> 20:34.420
It's a blessing for me.

20:37.310 --> 20:38.030
Mother,

20:39.270 --> 20:41.130
I'm here to pay my respects to you.

20:43.510 --> 20:44.980
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

20:56.350 --> 20:58.180
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

21:00.350 --> 21:03.030
[Virtuous and Serene, Honored in Peace]

21:14.760 --> 21:15.490
You're back.

21:16.270 --> 21:18.160
Were you injured
when chasing after the assassins?

21:18.160 --> 21:19.960
Your Highness, don't worry. I'm fine.

21:19.960 --> 21:20.960
Most of the escaped assassins

21:20.960 --> 21:22.270
have been caught and escorted

21:22.270 --> 21:23.000
to the Court of Judicial Review

21:23.000 --> 21:24.110
for interrogations.

21:24.110 --> 21:25.440
Vengeance is achieved.

21:25.640 --> 21:26.570
Thank you so much

21:26.720 --> 21:28.720
for your hard work over these years.

21:29.830 --> 21:30.290
This...

21:30.440 --> 21:31.110
T-This...

21:31.790 --> 21:33.720
Why the reverence, Your Highness?

21:33.880 --> 21:35.440
You've all made arduous efforts.

21:35.440 --> 21:36.550
Now, these efforts

21:36.750 --> 21:38.010
have finally paid off.

21:40.030 --> 21:40.760
We used to

21:40.830 --> 21:42.680
celebrate victories with drinks.

21:42.680 --> 21:43.960
His Highness plans to reward

21:43.960 --> 21:45.760
all our men with a feast tonight.

21:46.640 --> 21:47.160
That...

21:47.310 --> 21:48.310
That's terrific!

21:48.550 --> 21:49.030
Indeed.

21:49.030 --> 21:50.240
Now that our vengeance has been served,

21:50.240 --> 21:51.920
it's time
for a proper drinking party, isn't it?

21:51.920 --> 21:52.450
Exactly!

21:52.680 --> 21:53.400
Get ready

21:53.880 --> 21:55.160
for the celebration tonight.

21:55.160 --> 21:55.680
Sure!

21:56.960 --> 21:58.490
I'll get you drunk tonight!

22:00.220 --> 22:06.790
[Imperial Study]

22:08.900 --> 22:11.190
[Imperial Study]

22:13.760 --> 22:16.000
[Imperial Study]

22:21.470 --> 22:22.560
[Songcheng Hall]

22:23.530 --> 22:24.620
Your Majesty...

22:23.610 --> 22:26.290
[Songcheng Hall]

22:27.070 --> 22:28.600
I'm here to beg His Majesty,

22:29.370 --> 22:30.950
but hasn't been granted a meeting.

22:30.590 --> 22:32.650
[Imperial Study]

22:32.200 --> 22:33.930
I'm still trying to save my son.

22:35.750 --> 22:36.640
Your Majesty,

22:38.200 --> 22:39.600
could you please help me?

22:40.310 --> 22:41.910
I'm barely of help to myself.

22:42.750 --> 22:44.750
How am I supposed to be of help to you?

22:45.070 --> 22:46.730
Marquis, can you do me a favor,

22:47.480 --> 22:49.410
by bringing my father back to life?

22:53.790 --> 22:54.920
I've heard

22:55.580 --> 22:58.810
[Songcheng Hall]

22:56.310 --> 22:57.970
what happened to Zhuang Shen.

22:59.350 --> 23:00.160
Marquis,

23:01.790 --> 23:04.320
are you also going to
say "condolences" to me?

23:05.160 --> 23:06.490
I can't bring myself...

23:07.790 --> 23:09.200
to say that word.

23:12.790 --> 23:13.550
Marquis,

23:14.750 --> 23:15.590
thank you.

23:17.680 --> 23:20.400
I hate that word more than anything
right now.

23:27.450 --> 23:29.690
[Imperial Study]

23:31.850 --> 23:34.510
[Imperial Study]

23:38.960 --> 23:39.690
Out of my way!

23:40.690 --> 23:42.380
I have to go in to meet His Majesty.

23:42.380 --> 23:45.480
[Imperial Study]

23:42.680 --> 23:44.590
Unless His Majesty
removes me from my position,

23:44.590 --> 23:46.550
I am still the Empress of Susha.

23:47.590 --> 23:49.120
Standing in my way like this

23:49.350 --> 23:50.750
shows utter disrespect!

23:51.270 --> 23:53.130
I can have you executed right now.

23:53.960 --> 23:54.920
Move aside!

23:55.370 --> 23:57.950
[Imperial Study]

23:55.920 --> 23:58.720
Let the Empress in!

23:59.680 --> 24:02.860
[Imperial Study]

24:06.640 --> 24:08.000
Celebrate victories with drinks—

24:08.000 --> 24:08.920
who said that?

24:09.030 --> 24:10.880
Miss Yixiao said it.

24:11.000 --> 24:11.960
But doesn't His Highness often tell us

24:11.960 --> 24:13.240
to always keep our composure?

24:13.240 --> 24:14.310
Why is he hanging on Miss Yixiao's

24:14.310 --> 24:15.000
every word now?

24:15.000 --> 24:15.920
What do you think the reason is?

24:15.920 --> 24:16.680
Can you take a break

24:16.680 --> 24:19.310
from archery practice
and use your brain for once?

24:19.310 --> 24:20.590
We're drinking already.

24:20.590 --> 24:21.590
Go on. Have more.

24:23.110 --> 24:24.310
Drink as much as you can!

24:24.310 --> 24:25.400
-Sure!
-Great!

24:26.720 --> 24:27.380
Catch this!

24:28.070 --> 24:29.330
Here comes more booze.

24:32.400 --> 24:33.000
Come on.

24:35.200 --> 24:35.720
Cheers!

24:36.590 --> 24:38.160
Bottoms up! Come on!

24:38.160 --> 24:39.270
With this drink down,

24:39.270 --> 24:41.070
may we have many more victories!

24:47.110 --> 24:47.970
Your Highness.

24:48.030 --> 24:48.510
Come on.

24:49.110 --> 24:51.040
Let me fill Your Highness's glass.

24:51.550 --> 24:52.950
On this joyful occasion,

24:53.030 --> 24:54.690
let's forgo the formalities.

24:54.880 --> 24:55.830
Really?

24:56.030 --> 24:57.510
Then pardon me for boldly

24:57.510 --> 24:58.920
calling you "Chief"!

25:01.030 --> 25:01.550
Okay.

25:02.070 --> 25:02.870
As you please.

25:04.030 --> 25:04.640
Chief!

25:05.680 --> 25:06.880
There's a performance for you.

25:06.880 --> 25:07.410
Yun Fang!

25:08.070 --> 25:08.550
Come here.

25:08.550 --> 25:09.280
Stop eating.

25:09.480 --> 25:10.720
You practiced for a sword dance, right?

25:10.720 --> 25:11.960
Perform it for His Highness.

25:11.960 --> 25:12.590
Do it now.

25:13.790 --> 25:14.650
Your Highness,

25:14.750 --> 25:15.920
why not let me perform a sword dance?

25:15.920 --> 25:16.720
That's right.

25:17.070 --> 25:18.400
Would you like to see it?

25:19.270 --> 25:20.350
Don't go to all that trouble.

25:20.350 --> 25:21.550
Just enjoy the feast.

25:21.590 --> 25:22.920
Then get a good sleep.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.640
Alright then. Let's eat.

25:24.830 --> 25:25.550
Enjoy the feast.

25:25.550 --> 25:26.920
Let's listen to Mrs. Feng from now on.

25:26.920 --> 25:27.310
Sure!

25:27.640 --> 25:29.110
We'll all listen to Mrs. Feng.

25:29.110 --> 25:29.790
Guys,

25:29.960 --> 25:31.420
let's do as Mrs. Feng says!

25:31.640 --> 25:33.480
We'll do as Mrs. Feng says!

25:34.680 --> 25:36.070
Do as Mrs. Feng says!

25:37.310 --> 25:37.920
You see,

25:38.000 --> 25:40.070
His Highness is my chief.

25:40.160 --> 25:42.420
I should respect you as Mrs. Feng, right?

25:42.920 --> 25:43.550
Oh my.

25:43.640 --> 25:45.240
Look how shy His Highness is.

25:47.480 --> 25:49.480
That's not someone shy would do!

25:53.960 --> 25:54.550
Alright.

25:54.680 --> 25:55.510
Seriously,

25:55.640 --> 25:56.240
not all of you

25:56.240 --> 25:57.000
get to call her

25:57.000 --> 25:57.730
"Mrs. Feng."

25:57.790 --> 25:59.240
Only I have that privilege.

25:59.240 --> 25:59.950
Says who?

26:00.160 --> 26:01.640
All of us are His Majesty's buddies.

26:01.640 --> 26:03.070
We should call her "Mrs. Feng"!

26:03.070 --> 26:03.790
Am I right, guys?

26:03.790 --> 26:04.310
Right!

26:05.640 --> 26:06.970
-Mrs. Feng!
-Mrs. Feng!

26:07.720 --> 26:10.550
Mrs. Feng!

26:11.590 --> 26:13.160
He who chants again
will be punished with drinks!

26:13.160 --> 26:13.830
Mrs. Feng would like to

26:13.830 --> 26:15.790
-punish us with drinks!
-Drinks!

26:16.070 --> 26:16.790
Raise our glasses!

26:16.790 --> 26:17.270
Come on!

26:22.830 --> 26:23.440
Mrs. Feng,

26:24.160 --> 26:25.240
I'll drink this up to show my respect,

26:25.240 --> 26:26.640
since I'm bad with words.

26:29.200 --> 26:29.800
Mrs. Feng,

26:30.000 --> 26:30.600
thank you.

26:34.680 --> 26:36.790
His Highness has finally taken revenge.

26:36.790 --> 26:38.350
The credit goes to all of you.

26:38.350 --> 26:39.950
Thank you for your hard work.

26:40.000 --> 26:41.000
Here's a toast to you!

26:41.000 --> 26:42.880
-To Mrs. Feng!
-To Mrs. Feng!

26:50.510 --> 26:51.200
Guys,

26:51.960 --> 26:53.350
many thanks for your efforts.

26:53.350 --> 26:55.210
I'd like to make a toast to you all!

26:55.240 --> 26:59.030
-To Chief!
-To Chief!

27:01.400 --> 27:02.130
Come on!

27:02.240 --> 27:02.770
Drink up!

27:13.160 --> 27:14.510
Now that you're here,

27:14.720 --> 27:16.160
just feel free to

27:16.310 --> 27:17.640
speak your mind.

27:18.000 --> 27:19.400
Today marks

27:20.400 --> 27:23.680
the end of our marriage.

27:25.000 --> 27:26.130
There will be no need

27:26.420 --> 27:29.020
to see each other again
in the rest of our lives.

27:29.680 --> 27:30.480
I'm not here

27:30.480 --> 27:31.880
to salvage our marriage.

27:32.830 --> 27:34.160
I'm here for Chengyang.

27:34.920 --> 27:36.350
For Chengyang?

27:38.750 --> 27:39.440
What now?

27:40.400 --> 27:42.200
Hearing that the First Prince

27:43.070 --> 27:45.130
has completely severed ties with me,

27:45.270 --> 27:48.200
you can't wait to secure
the throne for Chengyang?

27:51.590 --> 27:52.960
Now, I finally realize

27:54.400 --> 27:56.000
how you actually think of me.

27:58.440 --> 28:00.200
What you're really like

28:00.680 --> 28:02.080
doesn't matter anymore.

28:02.480 --> 28:05.400
I will not pass the throne
on to Chengyang.

28:06.640 --> 28:08.550
Get that idea out of your mind.

28:20.070 --> 28:20.960
If anyone

28:21.440 --> 28:22.070
is to shoulder the blame,

28:22.070 --> 28:23.600
it should be me, his mother.

28:24.720 --> 28:27.650
Your Majesty,
please don't take it out on Chengyang.

28:27.960 --> 28:29.030
I'll bestow

28:30.030 --> 28:31.830
the title of Grand Prince on him.

28:32.400 --> 28:35.270
As long as he assists his brother
with loyalty,

28:35.400 --> 28:37.270
he can live the rest of his life

28:37.270 --> 28:38.720
peacefully.

28:39.750 --> 28:40.590
Loyalty?

28:41.440 --> 28:42.790
How is he supposed to serve

28:42.790 --> 28:45.160
the killer of his grandfather
with loyalty?

28:45.160 --> 28:46.030
How is he supposed to

28:46.030 --> 28:47.070
forget what happened

28:47.070 --> 28:48.400
when he knows it was all true?

28:48.400 --> 28:49.830
As a member of the royal family,

28:49.830 --> 28:51.270
he has no other choice.

28:52.590 --> 28:54.350
This is his fate.

28:56.030 --> 28:56.590
Besides,

28:57.590 --> 28:59.920
though I'll make him a Grand Prince,

29:00.400 --> 29:01.960
he won't be allowed to step

29:01.960 --> 29:03.240
out of Yujing.

29:04.310 --> 29:06.510
This is in the best interests

29:07.070 --> 29:08.330
of him and his brother.

29:10.160 --> 29:11.240
I will not

29:11.240 --> 29:13.570
dismiss you from the position of Empress.

29:14.110 --> 29:15.160
Isn't it

29:16.200 --> 29:18.350
what you want most?

29:32.310 --> 29:33.400
Thank you,

29:35.070 --> 29:36.550
Your Majesty.

29:37.350 --> 29:38.270
I'm tired.

29:39.960 --> 29:41.240
You may leave.

29:57.270 --> 29:58.590
Can I dress

30:00.240 --> 30:02.370
Your Majesty's hair for one last time?

30:03.350 --> 30:04.350
After today,

30:05.550 --> 30:07.440
we will never meet again.

30:07.960 --> 30:09.720
Despite all my mistakes,

30:10.110 --> 30:12.310
I've truly given Your Majesty my heart.

30:12.640 --> 30:14.970
My affection for Your Majesty is genuine.

30:15.440 --> 30:17.240
Your Majesty looks pallid,
after just recovering

30:17.240 --> 30:18.570
from a serious illness.

30:18.720 --> 30:20.680
I would hate to have any regrets

30:21.070 --> 30:22.590
on the day of our parting.

30:24.400 --> 30:26.400
Please grant my wish, Your Majesty.

30:26.440 --> 30:27.790
Is this

30:28.550 --> 30:30.310
your one last request?

30:31.310 --> 30:32.110
Yes.

30:34.880 --> 30:36.080
Your wish is granted.

30:47.640 --> 30:49.350
Thank you, Your Majesty.

31:14.640 --> 31:15.440
Your Majesty,

31:16.590 --> 31:18.310
Chengyang does have a choice.

31:20.680 --> 31:22.920
I won't leave him with no choice.

31:27.340 --> 31:29.170
My son shall not cave in to fate!

31:39.030 --> 31:39.680
Guards...

31:40.000 --> 31:41.070
Guards!

31:43.680 --> 31:44.920
Help...

31:56.400 --> 31:57.070
Murong...

31:58.110 --> 31:58.750
Wait!

32:30.680 --> 32:32.270
I've already...

32:33.030 --> 32:34.270
pardoned...

32:41.640 --> 32:43.480
Protect... Suige...

32:44.000 --> 32:44.790
Protect...

33:39.220 --> 33:40.020
Your Majesty,

33:40.720 --> 33:41.550
I'll settle

33:42.280 --> 33:43.920
this matter for you.

33:44.480 --> 33:45.480
Will Your Majesty

33:46.010 --> 33:48.150
help my son Yao?

33:54.440 --> 33:55.640
Yes. You have my word.

33:59.480 --> 34:00.210
Many thanks,

34:00.960 --> 34:01.960
Your Majesty.

34:05.830 --> 34:06.630
Your Majesty,

34:06.730 --> 34:07.550
our priority

34:08.440 --> 34:09.760
is to keep His Majesty's death

34:09.760 --> 34:11.310
secret.

34:12.030 --> 34:13.030
I will then

34:13.760 --> 34:15.320
take care of the rest.

34:30.320 --> 34:32.920
Harder! Harder! Harder!

34:32.920 --> 34:34.070
Harder!

34:34.070 --> 34:35.590
Use more strength!

34:35.590 --> 34:36.340
Harder!

34:36.370 --> 34:37.070
Harder!

34:37.090 --> 34:38.070
Try harder!

35:06.110 --> 35:07.510
-Drink up!
-Drink up!

35:17.960 --> 35:18.800
Come on!

36:14.890 --> 36:17.040
[Imperial Study]

36:19.330 --> 36:21.000
[Imperial Study]

36:21.670 --> 36:22.440
-Eunuch Ma.
-Your Grace.

36:22.440 --> 36:23.030
Don't go in yet.

36:23.030 --> 36:23.800
Why, Your Grace?

36:23.800 --> 36:24.480
I have a report

36:24.480 --> 36:25.940
to make to His Majesty now.

36:26.360 --> 36:27.000
Eunuch Ma,

36:27.000 --> 36:28.670
you are His Majesty's most trusted person.

36:28.670 --> 36:29.440
I'm sure His Majesty

36:29.440 --> 36:30.880
would always heed what you say.

36:30.880 --> 36:32.510
I'm very flattered, Your Grace.

36:32.510 --> 36:33.230
His Majesty

36:33.320 --> 36:35.050
would not blindly take my word.

36:36.450 --> 36:37.270
[Imperial Study]

36:41.000 --> 36:42.320
I must save my son.

36:43.030 --> 36:44.110
You have to help me.

36:44.230 --> 36:46.550
Please don't put me in a pickle,
Your Grace.

36:46.550 --> 36:47.520
I'd love to help,

36:47.760 --> 36:49.440
but there's nothing I can do.

37:09.020 --> 37:10.060
[Imperial Study]

37:22.790 --> 37:25.780
[Imperial Study]

37:27.920 --> 37:28.720
To the palace.

38:02.840 --> 38:03.360
Father.

38:07.190 --> 38:07.760
Yao,

38:08.360 --> 38:10.290
all of this was done by the Empress.

38:10.670 --> 38:11.310
Uncle,

38:11.400 --> 38:12.280
I've taken care of

38:11.570 --> 38:14.280
[General of Jinwu Guards, Murong Jie]

38:12.360 --> 38:13.360
all the Jinwu Guards outside,

38:13.360 --> 38:14.760
except those on our side.

38:16.880 --> 38:18.340
I'll go out and keep watch.

38:22.480 --> 38:23.130
Father...

38:23.630 --> 38:24.840
In order to save you,

38:27.470 --> 38:29.670
Feng Pingcheng must die.

38:32.030 --> 38:32.980
Next,

38:33.640 --> 38:35.620
Feng Suige will have to die too.

38:37.230 --> 38:38.690
I believe you've realized

38:39.350 --> 38:40.670
the Murong family

38:41.360 --> 38:43.290
has reached the point of no return.

38:44.320 --> 38:46.210
No. I'm the only rebel here.

38:46.280 --> 38:47.550
I'm the one
who's hit the point of no return.

38:47.550 --> 38:48.440
You and the rest

38:48.510 --> 38:50.440
of the Murong family are innocent.

38:51.920 --> 38:52.440
Father,

38:52.760 --> 38:54.230
I can't drag you into this mess.

38:54.230 --> 38:55.480
Please leave right now.

38:55.480 --> 38:56.030
What happened here

38:56.030 --> 38:56.960
tonight was all my doing.

38:56.960 --> 38:58.760
I'll bear all the consequences.

38:59.000 --> 38:59.320
Go!

38:59.320 --> 39:00.280
Remember this:

39:01.510 --> 39:02.960
there are consequences

39:04.360 --> 39:06.280
to every decision you make.

39:07.070 --> 39:09.070
This decision I'm making results from

39:09.070 --> 39:10.960
the fact that I can't bear

39:11.070 --> 39:12.800
the consequence of losing you.

39:15.320 --> 39:18.250
Only you are the most important
to the Murong family.

40:08.000 --> 40:09.000
Your Highness...

40:17.070 --> 40:17.780
What's up?

40:17.880 --> 40:18.740
Your Highness,

40:18.880 --> 40:20.150
His Majesty has fallen ill again.

40:20.150 --> 40:21.190
Mr. Ma asked me to bring Your Highness

40:21.190 --> 40:22.590
to the palace right away.

40:24.000 --> 40:24.800
Please leave.

40:25.030 --> 40:25.590
But...

40:25.880 --> 40:26.830
Mr. Ma said

40:27.000 --> 40:27.590
His Majesty

40:27.590 --> 40:29.250
was at death's door this time.

40:35.230 --> 40:36.400
Where is His Majesty?

40:36.400 --> 40:37.260
Your Highness,

40:37.480 --> 40:38.590
His Majesty is in the Imperial Study.

40:38.590 --> 40:39.880
Why not in the bed chamber?

40:39.880 --> 40:41.190
Since His Majesty suddenly fell ill

40:41.190 --> 40:42.440
in the Imperial Study,

40:42.440 --> 40:45.300
Mr. Ma summoned
all the imperial physicians there.

40:46.400 --> 40:47.360
Here is the Imperial Study.

40:47.360 --> 40:48.070
Your Highness,

40:48.070 --> 40:49.470
I shall take my leave now.

40:50.410 --> 40:52.520
[Imperial Study]

40:54.470 --> 40:56.270
[Imperial Study]

41:00.160 --> 41:01.590
[Imperial Study]

41:20.650 --> 41:21.980
I didn't want to see you,

41:22.630 --> 41:24.560
but they told me you fell ill again.

41:35.000 --> 41:35.800
Your Majesty!

41:40.030 --> 41:40.830
Your Majesty!

41:41.320 --> 41:42.120
Your Majesty!

42:06.590 --> 42:08.280
Uncle Murong...

42:42.710 --> 42:45.000
Did you do all of this?

42:48.960 --> 42:50.280
Why?
